{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21696","headline":"酬乐天得微之诗知通州事因成四首 二 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天得微之诗知通州事因成四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平地才应一顷余，阁栏都大似巢居。\n入衙官吏声疑鸟，下峡舟船腹似鱼。\n市井无钱论尺丈，田畴付火罢耘锄。\n此中愁杀须甘分，惟惜平生旧着书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21696.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21696","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}